  "local_avatar_path": "",
  "content_html": "<div id=\"main\">\n\t\t<section id=\"primary\">\n\t\t\t<div id=\"profile\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cover\" style=\"background-image: url();\"><div class=\"scores\"><span class=\"score-label\">累積人氣<span class=\"score\"></span></span><span class=\"score-label\">累積讚數<span class=\"score\"></span></span><span class=\"score-label\">台客獎章<span class=\"score\"></span></span></div></div><div class=\"author-info\"><img src=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/wp-content/uploads/avatars/48/d1ce473e1f7a6d7a7b3ee20660f1217a-bpthumb.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"avatar user-48-avatar\" width='150' height='150' /><h2 class=\"name-title\">宇宙人</h2><h3 class=\"description\"></h3><div class=\"bio\"></div></div>\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<hr>\n\t\t\t<h2>宇宙人 發表的文章</h2>\n\t\t\t<div id=\"content\" role=\"main\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"article-div divider\">\t\t\t\t\n<article id=\"post-1298\" class=\"post-1298 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-life-at-mozilla\">\n\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/1298/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb%e8%88%87%e5%b7%a5%e4%bd%9c%e7%9a%84%e8%b6%85%e5%ae%8c%e7%be%8e%e5%af%a6%e8%b8%90%ef%bc%8d%e6%88%91%e7%9a%84-cs-%e4%ba%ba%e7%94%9f\" title=\"Permalink to 生活與工作的超完美實踐－我的 CS 人生\" rel=\"bookmark\">生活與工作的超完美實踐－我的 CS 人生</a></h2>\n    <p class=\"entry-posted\">\n      <time datetime=\"2014-05-14T10:01:17+00:00\" title=\"2014-05-14T10:01:17+00:00\" class=\"published\">\n        <a title=\"See all posts from May, 2014\" href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/date/2013/02\" class=\"posted-month\">2月</a>\n        <span class=\"posted-date\">27</span>\n        <a title=\"See all posts from 2014\" href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/date/2013\" class=\"posted-year\">2013</a>\n      </time>\n    </p>\n      \t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-meta\">\n      <div class=\"author-meta\" data-author-id=\"48\">\n        <a href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/author/bechenmozilla-com\">\n          <img src=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/wp-content/uploads/avatars/48/d1ce473e1f7a6d7a7b3ee20660f1217a-bpthumb.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"avatar user-48-avatar\" width='24' height='24' /><!--\n       --><div class=\"author-info\">宇宙人</div><!--\n       --><div class=\"author-title\"></div>\n        </a>\n        </div>\n      </div><!-- .entry-meta -->\n\t\t\t</header><!-- .entry-header -->\n\n\n\t<div class=\"thumb-img\"><img src=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/wp-content/uploads/2013/01/pic1-150x150.jpg\"/></div>\t<div class=\"entry-content half\">\n\t\t自從指考分發到資訊系後，掐指一算也過了十個年頭了。\r\n\r\n在這十年的過程中，除了敲敲鍵盤 coding 以外，我的 CS 人生也就此開始...\r\n\r\n學以致用，相信大家都聽過這句話，不過宇宙人我可是把 CS 學到的東西實踐到日常生活中呢!!\r\n\r\n\t電梯篇:  搭電梯時，一定要做的兩件事那就是 1.按樓層 2. 按關門。 想像一下 1 就好像是 CPU 處理一件小事情，2 就好像是一個 IO 事件.....<a class=\"more\" href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/1298/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb%e8%88%87%e5%b7%a5%e4%bd%9c%e7%9a%84%e8%b6%85%e5%ae%8c%e7%be%8e%e5%af%a6%e8%b8%90%ef%bc%8d%e6%88%91%e7%9a%84-cs-%e4%ba%ba%e7%94%9f\">深入了解</a>  \n\t</div><!-- .entry-content -->\n\t\n  <footer class=\"entry-footer\">\n            <div class=\"entry-category-box\">\n      文章分類：\n      <a href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/category/life-at-mozilla\" rel=\"category tag\">Life at Mozilla</a>    </div>\n        <div class=\"entry-social-box\">\n      社群分享：\n     <div class=\"fb-like\" data-href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/1298/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb%e8%88%87%e5%b7%a5%e4%bd%9c%e7%9a%84%e8%b6%85%e5%ae%8c%e7%be%8e%e5%af%a6%e8%b8%90%ef%bc%8d%e6%88%91%e7%9a%84-cs-%e4%ba%ba%e7%94%9f\" data-layout=\"button_count\" data-width=\"40\" data-show-faces=\"false\" data-font=\"arial\"></div>     <!-- Place this tag where you want the +1 button to render. -->\n     \n     <div class=\"google-share\"><div class=\"g-plusone\" name=\"gplus\" data-size=\"medium\" data-annotation=\"bubble\" data-width=\"40\" data-href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/1298/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb%e8%88%8